 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K-MiyeV8h6QQ7kNvwHnW3bf&_nc_oc=Adpx-WNB5Rc9tvHDpdbjZ8JkSa3xuWvyrlwkBOPKEAQjpeS_qXqO_jTCpem8a_eIJ7o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOsEo_Q16wGA5jKZvLFD7_iyvTVjfMhYNVrn3OObeUXWw&oe=6ACE4BC1"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_dBrYa7sgOYQ7kNvwGkH0mu&_nc_oc=AdrAWZPXSzXzUnKeQw53Sbhyh23_lZX-QbPImXiuMOzwdf7tZWryKhuopxuFR2EHM9s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQODPbC7VCGzfOtWmoGzbDlwFg98uukwcC99IE_K5D7Rpw&oe=6ACE5926"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N7C11UO_pL0Q7kNvwEOibqK&_nc_oc=AdriWWPvTt-WrwkCY9q8-yzscG9x7gJswrdIO4RnOTmFEwihrymv2x14vqu222jbCvY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPRri7LBRAA4v9u_dUkGgcVeTUnZvmIIv1N_sSBlG6Rbg&oe=6ACE631C"}, {"fil